if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.march_line = 2;
Q.militancy += 10;
Q.repression += 10;
Q.red_guards_strength -= 1;
Q.district_berlin_members -= 0.8;
Q.district_berlin_loyalty += 6;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 8;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 6;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
!}

Our people join the sailors at the barricades in Lichtenberg. For four days, the east of Berlin is a battlefield.

- @terror: Continue...

@with_spd
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Right's answer: a stronger strike, and a narrower one.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids sitting with the social democrats.
