if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.march_line = 3;
Q.worker_support += 5;
Q.spd_relation += 6;
Q.repression += 3;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 8;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 8;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
Q.lean_ultraleft -= 1;
!}

The committee is united again, for a few days. The power stations keep the strike going, and the government, for once, has to negotiate. Then the fighting in the east begins without anyone's permission.

- @terror: Continue...

@terror
title: Noske's Order
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.rote_fahne_banned = 1;
Q.repression += 3;
Q.freikorps_strength += 20;
// Liebknecht at the barricades
if (Q.liebknecht_alive == 1 && Q.march_line == 2 && Math.random() < 0.4) {
    Q.liebknecht_alive = 0;
    Q.liebknecht_advisor = 0;
    Q.liebknecht_march_death = 1;
    Q.militancy += 5;
}
!}

= Noske's Order

On 9 March, after newspaper reports, all of them false, that the rebels had massacred the police in Lichtenberg, Noske ordered that anyone found carrying arms against the government be shot on the spot. The troops used field guns, mortars and aircraft against the tenements of the east. Twenty-nine sailors of the People's Naval Division who came to collect their pay were taken into a courtyard in the Französische Strasse and shot. About twelve hundred people are dead.

[? if liebknecht_march_death = 1 : Karl Liebknecht was among the fighters in Lichtenberg. He was recognised at a checkpoint and shot. ?] The strike has collapsed. The party is banned in all but name, and *Die Rote Fahne* is printed in secret.

Leo Jogiches has spent two months finding the men who killed Luxemburg and Liebknecht. The police know where he sleeps.

- @leave: Order Jogiches to leave Berlin.
- @hide: Hide him in a flat only the Zentrale knows.
- @work: Let him finish his investigation.

@leave
subtitle: He will refuse unless the order is firm. The investigation stops.
on-arrival: {!
var risk = 15 + Math.random() * 30;
Q.jogiches_alive = risk < 40 ? 1 : 0;
Q.unity -= 2;
!}
go-to: jogiches

@hide
